e":null,"lang":"en","pages":13,"createdAt":"2026-02-20T13:54:36+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"6297248a-3ed3-4ff7-b68c-a38205d6a9b2","number":"109","volume":"9","title":"Kashiwada-san dan Oota-kun Pergi Ski","lang":"id","pages":15,"createdAt":"2026-01-02T04:47:58+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"ffb378f8-8923-4edf-bdf7-25b199326c84","number":"108","volume":"9","title":null,"lang":"en","pages":15,"createdAt":"2026-02-17T15:31:18+00:00","baked":false},{"id":"f500b754-134c-4b7f-b8a5-619fd1f2e58b","number":"108","volume":"9","title":"Sesi Belajar Bersama Kashiwada-san dan Oota-kun","lang":"id","pages":17,"createdAt":"2026-01-02T04:47:57+00:00","baked":false}],"chapterCount":313,"chaptersAt":"2026-10-19T10:27:40.012Z"},"fb716acf-4257-4613-bf30-32d7c32dc199":{"id":"fb716acf-4257-4613-bf30-32d7c32dc199","title":"The Forgotten Field","altTitle":"잊혀진 들판","description":"I pray every dayfor this love to die.\nThat I may love you only until today,\nand by tomorrow, may this love be dead.\n\n-Born of an affair, the ill-fated imperial princess Thalia Roem Guirta.\n\nShe grows up twisted beneath the neglect of indifferent parents, hostile half-siblings,\nand servants who look upon her with contempt.\nTo survive, Thalia learns to protect herself by baring her thorns at everyone who comes near.\nAnd yet, even she becomes utterly defenseless before one man.\n\nThat man is Varkas Raedgo Seorkan, the noble young lord of the East.\n\nA vassal of the imperial family and heir to a grand duke,\nhe was raised under relentless pressure to be perfect.\nShaped by discipline so harsh it bordered on abuse,\nhe grew up with most of his emotions long since numbed.\nA man who exists solely for his family’s honor and duty.\n\nTo keep a promise made to the late empress,\nhe becomes engaged to Ayla, Thalia’s half-sister.\n\nAnd Thalia, consumed by despair, begins to slowly break apart.\n\nBut then—\n\nthe love fated to end in her death reaches an unexpected turning point….","year":null,"status":"ongoing","l